WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Before you open The Signal, here is what the free first gate is for.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.393
Numinous is a place to meet each new vision without rushing to the next image.

00:00:12.393 --> 00:00:18.679
This film is an orientation, not a receipt and not proof that any account has access.

00:00:18.679 --> 00:00:22.607
When you choose to enter, the gate opens through Whop.

00:00:22.607 --> 00:00:27.321
There is no card requirement and no recurring charge for The Signal.

00:00:27.321 --> 00:00:30.071
The room is meant to stay free.

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:36.357
Start with Dispatches: a place to find announcements and follow what is new in the realms.

00:00:36.357 --> 00:00:41.071
You do not have to buy a second product to remain here.

00:00:41.071 --> 00:00:45.000
Take the time to look around before making that choice.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.286
The First Vision is the entry reading for this world.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:01:01.429
It introduces the chambers and gives you a way to approach the record before you follow a larger cycle.

00:01:01.429 --> 00:01:07.857
The rooms have different purposes, and this tour is only a preview of their names.

00:01:07.857 --> 00:01:10.429
The Signal is the open beginning.

00:01:10.429 --> 00:01:14.714
The Realm is where a new being comes into view.

00:01:14.714 --> 00:01:22.429
The Process turns attention to the craft behind the vision: what was made and how it was shaped.

00:01:22.429 --> 00:01:30.143
The Records hold the story underneath the image, so the work can be revisited rather than scrolled past.

00:01:30.143 --> 00:01:38.286
These rooms are shown here as a map, not as a promise that your browser has already unlocked them.

00:01:38.286 --> 00:01:43.000
Check your Whop library for the access available to your account.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:52.104
The Session marks a moment to return to the work and ask questions.

00:01:52.104 --> 00:01:57.207
The Field Journal leaves room for your own notes as the story changes.

00:01:57.207 --> 00:02:03.881
The Sanctuary is the shared space around the gates: a place to stay connected to other travellers.

00:02:03.881 --> 00:02:07.807
The calendar shows the rhythm of future realms and announcements.

00:02:07.807 --> 00:02:11.341
You can follow those signals at your own pace.

00:02:11.341 --> 00:02:14.874
No additional gate is required to keep The Signal.

00:02:14.874 --> 00:02:20.370
The Watcher is a separate membership if you later want a structured twenty-eight-day cycle.

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:25.867
The Vault and the Agent are also separate choices, not conditions for entry here.

00:02:25.867 --> 00:02:32.541
If you want the free gate, use the button below this film to review the Whop entry.

00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:40.000
After you join, verify the room in the Whop account you used; this page cannot grant access by itself.
